   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With…",
     "texto": [
      "To express company («with whom»), **с** + instrumental is used: **с мамой** (with my mum), **с братом** (with my brother), **с другом** (with a friend).",
      "To ask «with whom?» you say **С кем?**, with **кем**, the instrumental of **кто**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The instrumental endings",
     "texto": [
      "In these examples, masculine nouns form the instrumental in **-ом** (**брат** → **братом**, **друг** → **другом**) or **-ем** (**муж** → **мужем**). Feminine nouns in **-а** form the instrumental in **-ой**: **мама** → **мамой**, **сестра** → **сестрой**, **подруга** → **подругой**.",
      "**Вдвоём** (the two of them together) and **втроём** (the three of them together) are fixed words: they never change."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
